  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Channel Despair and Darkness to Protect Others</p></blockquote><p>Sorrow knights fill their opponents with grief and misery from the gloomy plane of the Shadowfell. They harness their own past despair to forge bonds with others and protect themselves. A sorrow knight's deep loss—of love, faith, or something just as profound—is both the weapon they wield and their drive to spare others the same pain.</p><h4>Embracing the Gloom</h4><p>Sorrow knights wield the gloom of the Shadowfell whether or not they have ever been there. Roll on or choose from the Shadowfell Connection table to inspire the event that forged your bond with it.</p><table><thead><tr><th>1d6</th><th>The Despair of the Shadowfell Claimed You After…</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>You arrived too late to save your home from the monsters that destroyed it.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>You realized that a good-aligned god never meant to answer your prayers.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>You were not strong enough to save the love of your life from an untimely death.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>A shadow crossing opened beneath your bed when you were a child.</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>You understood that your parents were never coming back to save you.</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>You fell into an open grave.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Sorrow Knight Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.jxQG2yxWipzBOE8w]{Despairing Strikes}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.E9cXWeTK5ovtFfgF]{Solemn Gaze}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.IciGsC8D9b8gMBbS]{Dreaded Appearance}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.Otod2LN7WNCdFV2e]{Unsettled Strikes}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.395rH4mHXUKwCU8z]{Grim Constitution}</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.eSk6SIxsT73kc6SC]{Grieving Mantle}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
